'''Banffozoa''' is a [[class (biology)|class]] within the phylum [[Vetulicolia]], and the senior synonym of Heteromorphida.<ref>{{harvnb|Harper|Hammarlund|Topper|Nielsen|2019|page=711}}</ref>  It may be [[paraphyletic]] even if Vetulicolia is [[monophyletic]].<ref name=AldridgeBasics>{{harvnb|Aldridge|Hou|Siveter|Siveter|2007|pages=147–148}}</ref>  Banffozoa includes the genera ''Banffia'', ''Heteromorphus'', and ''Skeemella'' in the family Banffidae, order Banffiata,<ref>{{harvnb|Li|Williams|Gabbott|Chen|2018|pages=1083–1084}}</ref> as well as an undescribed ''Heteromorphus''-like species of uncertain placement labeled "Form A."<ref>{{harvnb|Shu|2005|page=2349}}</ref>

